# Compose UI

Screens capture events and render state from ViewModels. No MQTT, Room, or topic strings in `ui/`.

Dark Material3 (`0xFF121212`). `AddChatDialog` / new-chat action stays a required hub function.

```kotlin
// BAD
@Composable
fun ChatScreen(mqtt: MqttManager) { mqtt.publish(...) }

// GOOD
@Composable
fun ChatScreen(viewModel: ChatViewModel) { /* collect StateFlow, call viewModel.send */ }
```
